Bb7 14. a3 Bc6 15. Rae1 Rad8
{ This is the main position - the main point of the Scheveningen chapter in the Taimanov Sicilian. }
16. Bd3 { Bd3 is not as harmless as it looks. } 16... Qd7
{ Qd7 is a surprising move prepared for Grand Prix events in 2017. The instructor also got a chance to play Qd7 himself. The idea: Nh5, Nf4 and e5 at some point. }
