19. Rxf4 e5
{ Black plays e5. Qd7 is doing a wonderful job - black exchanges the queen and doesn't even mind sacrificing this pawn as the two bishops give more than sufficient compensation. }
20. Rg4 exd4 21. e5 g6 { Nothing to panic - just g6. } 22. e6 Qe8
