18. h3 Ne5
{ Black has easy play. Not scared of Nd5 - just Bxd5 exd5 Bf6 with excellent position. }
) ) 12... Rb8
{ Rb8 is a typical waiting move. After Nc6 bxc6 Rb2 is threatened. With rook on b8, black can take on b2 - key difference. }
( 12... e5 { If black plays e5, white can take Nxc6 bxc6 fxe5 dxe5 and a5. }
13. Nxc6 bxc6 14. fxe5 dxe5 15. a5 ) 13. Qe1 { White plays Qe1. } 13... e5
{ Black plays e5. } 14. fxe5 dxe5 15. Qg3 Bd8
